# Glob patterns (relative to `skills/`) to exclude from the AGENTS bundle.
# One pattern per line. Lines starting with `#` are comments.
#
# Examples:
# archive/**
# drafts/**
# **/*.bak.md
#
# Default: build everything under `skills/`.
#
# Notes:
# - `skills/AGENTS.md` is skipped automatically by the bundler as the output file.
# - `AGENTS.sources.jsonl` is generated next to the bundle for traceability and is not
#   included in the zip.
